comment0.target=Quiz02Remove_then_reverse
comment1.params=head
comment1.target=Node\ reverseInPlace(Node)
comment1.text=\r\n\ Reverses\ a\ non-dummy-headed\ singly\ linked\ list\ in\ place.\r\n\r\n\ Time\ Complexity\:\ O(n)\r\n\ Space\ Complexity\:\ O(1)\r\n
comment2.params=head
comment2.target=Node\ oddReverse(Node)
comment2.text=\r\n\ Removes\ all\ even\ nodes\ and\ reverses\r\n\ the\ remaining\ odd\ nodes.\r\n
